[00:13.92]1. Jesus has commanded
[00:17.60]That we shine our light,
[00:21.32]Like the sun, impartial,
[00:25.94]Comforting and bright.
[00:29.62]Through the Holy Scriptures,
[00:33.76]Thoughts of peace are heard.
[00:37.98]May we now reflect his light
[00:42.22]As we teach God’s Word.
[00:50.52]2. Let God’s Kingdom message
[00:55.30]Speak to ev’ry heart;
[00:59.52]Let it shine before us
[01:03.00]As we play our part.
[01:07.72]Light from Scripture guides us
[01:11.42]As we bring good news.
[01:15.74]Sharing truth with ev’ryone;
[01:19.68]Truth is theirs to choose.
[01:28.72]3. Light from acts of kindness
[01:31.96]Brightens up this world,
[01:37.04]To our words adds beauty
[01:40.84]Like a priceless pearl.
[01:45.34]May our light keep shining
[01:49.00]As we do what’s right,
[01:53.80]Then our works will always be
[01:57.50]Pleasing in God’s sight.
